  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 17 + 98 ÷ 14 - 8 × 68 = 179 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ×\n\n17 + 98 ÷ 14 - 8 × 68 = 179 ⇒ 17 × **98 ÷ 14**__ - 8 + 68 = 179\n\n__**17 × **____7__ - 8 + 68 = 179\n\n__**119 + 68**__ - 8 = 179 \n\n__**187 - 8**__ = 179\n\n**179 = 179 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : + and -​\n\n17 + 98 ÷ 14 - 8 × 68 = 179 ⇒ 17 - **98 ÷ 14**__ + 8 × 68 = 179\n\n17 - 7 + __**8 × 68**__ = 179\n\n__**17 **____**+ 544**__ - 7 = 179\n\n__**561 - 7**__ = 179\n\n554 ≠ 179 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and × \n\n17 + 98 ÷ 14 - 8 × 68 = 179 ⇒ 17 + 98 × 14 - **8 ÷ 68**__ = 179\n\n17 + __**98 × 14**__ - 0.11 = 179\n\n__**17 + 1372**__ - 0.11 = 179\n\n__**1389 - 0.11**__ = 179\n\n1388.89 ≠ 179 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n\n \n• Option - (4) : + and ÷\n\n17 + 98 ÷ 14 - 8 × 68 = 179 ⇒ **17 ÷ 98**__ + 14 - 8 × 68 = 179\n\n0.17 + 14 - __**8 × 68**__ = 179\n\n__**0.17 + 14**__ - 544 = 179\n\n__**14.17 - 544**__ = 179\n\n-529.83 ≠ 179 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
